From the given property,
\begin{align*}
f(2048) &= 12^3 - f(0), \\
f(0) &= 0 \text{ (assuming $f(0)=0$ for $n=0$)}, \\
\end{align*}
Therefore,
\begin{align*}
f(2048) &= 12^3 - 0 = 1728.
\end{align*}
Thus, \(\boxed{f(2048) = 1728}\).

